The native source archive built by this package is generated from the pinned
GLIMPSE2 source tree in this repository. Its source files and included LICENSE
retain the upstream MIT notices. Cite the original GLIMPSE and GLIMPSE2 methods
when using these programs for scientific work.

SIMDe headers
=============

SIMDe is copyright Evan Nemerson and contributors. The pinned SIMDe headers
from the GLIMPSE2 upstream submodule are included in RGlimpse2's generated
native-source archive and remain under SIMDe's MIT licence. RGlimpse2 does not
load a SIMDe runtime library.

htslib
======

RGlimpse2 does not vendor htslib. It compiles and links the child executables
against the exact installed htslib contract exposed by Rduckhts. See Rduckhts
and htslib for their respective copyright and licence notices.
